<title>USA: Seaboard Q1 shr profit $3.59 vs loss $5.18.</title>
<headline>Seaboard Q1 shr profit $3.59 vs loss $5.18.</headline>
<dateline>SHAWNEE MISSION, Kan. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr profit	$3.59	     loss $5.18</p>
<p> Net profit	5,336	     loss 7,706</p>
<p> Revs		400,180		  297,631</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  1,488		    1,488</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: For quarters ended March 31.</p>
<p>The loss in 1996 Q1 includes a benefit of $3 million, or $2.02 a share for the cumulative change in the method of accounting for inventory.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Seaboard Corp</p>
